     <p style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴市第一中学</span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">20</span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">21</span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年“县管校聘”</span></p><p style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工作岗位聘任名单</span><span style="font-family: 方正小标宋简体;font-size: 22pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">公示</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为进一步深化中小学教师队伍管理体制改革，促进师资均衡配置，增强教师队伍活力，根据《全面深化新时代教师队伍建设改革的实施意见》（绍市委发〔2019〕32号）、《关于进一步完善中小学校专业技术岗位设置管理的通知》（绍市人社发〔2019〕75号）和《关于继续深化市直学校教师“县管校聘”管理改革实施方案》（绍市教〔2021〕43号）等文件精神，</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">按照《</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2021年绍兴市第一中学“县管校聘”实施方案</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">》</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要求，经过教职员工岗位申报，资格审查小组审核，由学校聘任工作领导小组确认，下列</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人员为</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">直聘或首轮聘任</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教职工</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（共计</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">208</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人）。</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 28.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">直聘</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人员</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">名单（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">25</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）：</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">张祖农</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">金江虹 刘夏进 王月琴 杨菊妃 </span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.44in;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">周文阳</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">金建忠 王学文 王炜荣 冯报春</span></p><p style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 